tic facilities and states that these facilities are available to students at designated times.","source_url":"https://rpublic.rollins.edu/sites/ASCPS/Catalogue%20Archive/CLA%20Catalogue%20Spring%202018.pdf","source_title":"College of Liberal Arts Catalogue Contents","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Student access is limited to designated times; verify current court availability before going.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rollins-annie-russell-theatre","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Annie Russell Theatre","title":"Annie Russell Theatre","subtitle":"Campus theatre for student artists and performances","notes":"Look for the current season and attend an age-appropriate performance, or support classmates whose work appears in the theatre’s student-artist productions.","short_summary":"A longstanding Rollins performance venue that presents work featuring student artists.","evidence_claim":"Rollins says its Theatre and Dance department stages musicals and plays featuring student artists in the Annie Russell Theatre, with performances open to the public.","source_url":"https://www.rollins.edu/annie-russell-theatre/","source_title":"The Annie Russell Theatre","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Tickets, performance dates, and entry conditions vary by production; consult the theatre’s current listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rollins-museum-of-art","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Rollins Museum of Art","title":"Rollins Museum of Art","subtitle":"Campus museum for art, inquiry, and student involvement","notes":"Visit during posted hours to view art, or explore the Student Council and student membership options if you want a continuing connection to the museum.","short_summary":"A campus museum with exhibitions and structured opportunities for Rollins students to engage with art and museum work.","evidence_claim":"The Rollins Museum of Art offers student resources including the RMA Student Council, student fellowships, work-study roles, and free student membership.","source_url":"https://www.rollins.edu/rma/learn/college-educators-students/","source_title":"College Educators & Students","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current posted hours are Tuesday and Thursday 10 a.m.–7 p.m.; Wednesday and Friday 10 a.m.–4 p.m.; Saturday and Sunday 11 a.m.–4 p.m.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
